                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwezi wasanu, mubuzuba bwakumi bwamwezi, nkokuti mumwaka wakumi amusanu aine wabwami bwa-Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni, Nebuzaradana mupati wabasikutabilila, mulanda wamwami wa-Babuloni, wakanjila mu-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
