                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapomegranite aakumabazu akali makumi aali musanu aane amusanu alimwi, amapomegranite oonse aakali zyungulukide kasabwe akali mwaanda.",
          "type": "text",
