                  "text": "Lev 26:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami wa-Babuloni wakabauma akubajaya nkukonya oko ku-Ribila munyika ya-Hamati. Mbuboobo ba-Juda mbubakatolwa mubuzike akugwisigwa munyika yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
