          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi mumwaka wamakumi obile aitatu wabwami bwa-Nebukadinezara, Nebuzaradana mupati wabasikutabilila wakatola mubuzike ba-Juda bali myanda iili musanu aibili amakumi one aali amusanu. Aboobo bantu boonse bakasika kuzyuulu zyone amyanda iili musanu aumwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
