              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela wakamwaambila caluse, wasumpula cuuno cakwe cabwami kwiinda zyuuno zyabaminyina mbaakali abo mu-Babuloni; ",
